@base = http://localhost:5078
@adminKey = replace-with-a-local-admin-key
@submissionId = replace-after-upload
@actionId = replace-action-id
@reportId = replace-report-id

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Upload assessment (VS Code REST Client syntax)
POST {{base}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=irei-boundary

--irei-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="organizationName"

Example Housing Society
--irei-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="assessment.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ../src/IreiMvp.Web/Data/Examples/IREI_MVP_Stage1_V2_NGOB_Demo.xlsx
--irei-boundary--

### Get complete eight-page view model
GET {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}

### Approve assessment version
POST {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedBy": "Authorized reviewer"
}

### Add action
POST {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/actions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entityType": "Portfolio",
  "entityId": "PORTFOLIO",
  "issue": "Review material DSCR movement",
  "owner": "CFO",
  "decisionBody": "Management",
  "riskLevel": "High"
}

### Complete action
PATCH {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/actions/{{actionId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed",
  "outcome": "Reviewed and accepted"
}

### Create frozen report snapshot
POST {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportName": "Board Stewardship Report",
  "purpose": "Board oversight",
  "recipient": "Board of Directors",
  "scope": "Approved assessment, risks, mission and capital evidence"
}

### Approve report
POST {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/reports/{{reportId}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvedBy": "Board Chair"
}

### Share report
POST {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/reports/{{reportId}}/share
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sharedBy": "Authorized user"
}

### Download frozen report
GET {{base}}/api/submissions/{{submissionId}}/reports/{{reportId}}/download
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Admin list
GET {{base}}/api/admin/submissions
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Download generated assessment workbook (admin)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/submissions/{{submissionId}}/output
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}
